+  /**
+   * amxts: `box`, checked first to hold a value when `local` may be read
+   * before its declaration has run - JavaScript's ReferenceError in the
+   * temporal dead zone: an abort that says so and ends the current call.
+   * Only such a variable pays for it (Local.closureTdz): one a function
